<title>BELGIUM: EU refers Bewag sell-off back to Germany.</title>
<headline>EU refers Bewag sell-off back to Germany.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had decided to refer to the Bundeskartellamt the sale of Bewag to VIAG and PreussenElektra and South Eastern Holding.  </p>
<p>&quot;The Commission...had agreed to do this as the case concerned distinct regional markets and not a substantive part of the EU market,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>The German federal cartel office asked the Commission last month to give it sole jurisdiction after the companies filed their plans for approval to Brussels under the EU's merger regulation.</p>
<p>The deal involves VIAG and the two other companies acquiring a 50.8 percent in Bewag, an electricity firm. -- Brussels 322 2876841</p>
